["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The KGB Double Agent Who Stopped Armageddon with Ben McIntyre MICE RockX Minox Tudeh Party brush contact dead drop\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-historyhit-一个苏联间谍的难言之隐-差点阻止了第三次世界大战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1f92a8a9105bdcbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">41:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>一个苏联间谍的难言之隐，差点阻止了第三次世界大战</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1981年，克格勃驻德黑兰高官主动向MI6投诚，动机不是钱也不是意识形态，而是他相信西方能治好他的性功能障碍——他交出的情报，让美英决定把苏联政变计划交给伊朗人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">冷战</span><span class=\"tag\">间谍</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"646: The Secret of My Death Memento Mori medevac frogman\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-tal-死后你留下的不是死因-是别人拼凑的你/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/25f52c21084864d0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">This American Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>死后你留下的不是死因，是别人拼凑的你</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">三个故事都在做同一件事：人死后，亲友只能靠短信、讣告、Facebook 留言这些零碎证据去还原一个已经无法开口的人——而拼出来的那个版本，往往和本人认知完全对不上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">叙事播客</span><span class=\"tag\">死亡</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Neurodiversity, Autism, Awe, and Religious Experience (with Jonathan Machnee) neurodivergent profound autism cognitive dissonance pressure cooker collective effervescence double empathy problem cessationism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-clearerthink-自闭症不是一条线-是十维谱系加四个遗传簇/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d6c2f45dd923b89a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:35:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Clearer Thinking</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>自闭症不是一条线，是十维谱系加四个遗传簇</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DSM-5 把马斯克和无法自己穿衣服的人塞进同一个桶，但自闭症没有生物标志物，只有四个遗传簇和一堆被误读的标签。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神经多样性</span><span class=\"tag\">自闭症</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"E199 AI投研的边界、能力与实战卡点 I David对话岗底斯首席 FDE FDE MOE Harness ETL QA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-touzishizhan-ai-不会让普通人变优秀-只会让优秀的人更优秀/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/84ddf31325c222e2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"投\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">投资实战派</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不会让普通人变优秀，只会让优秀的人更优秀</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">投研 Agent 的卡点不在模型，在数据治理和人的判断力；用海外模型会让你越来越笨，用国内模型逼你越来越聪明。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI投研</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"705. Queen Victoria’s Revenge: The Mad Emperor of Abyssinia (Part 1) Abyssinia Magdala Theodros II Hormuzd Rassam Walter Plowden Charles Duncan Cameron\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-restishistory-英国远征阿比西尼亚-一个皇帝把外交官全扣了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>英国远征阿比西尼亚：一个皇帝把外交官全扣了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">维多利亚女王没回一封信，特沃德罗斯二世就把英国领事、传教士全锁进马格达拉山顶，等来的是一支远征军。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">帝国史</span><span class=\"tag\">埃塞俄比亚</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Silicon Valley’s Starving for Compute Neocloud Neolab reticle panel level packaging RSI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-asianometry-2027-年算力会从短缺变成过剩-ai-泡沫未必破/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bde50d837c58c490-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">21:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>2027 年算力会从短缺变成过剩，AI 泡沫未必破</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2026 年底可用 AI 数据中心约 15 吉瓦，2027 年底冲到 45-55 吉瓦，增量 30-40 吉瓦。按每吉瓦 500 亿美元收入算，两家巨头要做出 7500 亿到 1.5 万亿美元，这个数字站不住。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">半导体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"395. Stalin: The Rise of A Tyrant (Part 1) Koba Bolsheviks / Mensheviks Russification\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-empirehist-斯大林在革命里只是个管账的-后来却成了总书记/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">33:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>斯大林在革命里只是个管账的，后来却成了总书记</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1917年列宁和托洛茨基在街头号召起义时，斯大林在做没人愿意干的组织与筹款工作。他后来成为总书记，靠的不是演说，而是坐在桌边。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">苏联史</span><span class=\"tag\">权力结构</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"8 Ways To Improve Your Outbound Sales outbound intent signals breakup message deliverability Sales Navigator\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-ycsp-外联回复率接近零-先别怪文案-先查你在发给谁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b47caf90a5aa280a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">12:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>外联回复率接近零，先别怪文案，先查你在发给谁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">外联像大海捞针：人不对，再完美的文案也不会落地。YC 合伙人给出的调试顺序是——先查收件人、再查公司、再看标题，最后才轮到文案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">外联销售</span><span class=\"tag\">早期创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"World Models, Robotics, and the Future of 3D AI world model Gaussian splat real to sim bullet time SFT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-a16z-世界模型不是视频生成-atlas-把-3d-控制做成了输入/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">23:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>世界模型不是视频生成：Atlas 把 3D 控制做成了输入</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">语言模型处理 token，世界模型处理物理空间。Atlas 的关键不是生成更长的视频，而是把相机和参考图放进 3D 坐标里当输入，让生成从老虎机变成导演。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span><span class=\"tag\">3D 生成</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"HoP 499 Beyond Belief: Bayle, Toleration, and Atheism invincible ignorance Manichaeism Theophrastus Redivivus\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-hopwag-第一个公开的无神论者-其实是个不敢出书的乡村神父/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec115ed691f40c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">23:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">History of Philosophy Without Any Gaps</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>第一个公开的无神论者，其实是个不敢出书的乡村神父</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">梅利耶写下了否定上帝存在的《遗书》，却只敢抄三份留给身后；贝尔则用怀疑论证明，宗教问题超出理性，因此没人有资格以信仰之名迫害他人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>19</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">无神论</span><span class=\"tag\">宗教宽容</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1357: Furin, Naturally with Paul Bieinasz furin cleavage site NSP15 RXXR sarbecovirus OC43\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-twiv-造一个-furin-位点根本不难-难的是承认它不罕见/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">1:44:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>造一个 furin 位点根本不难，难的是承认它不罕见</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">深度测序显示，冠状病毒基因组里每千个就有几个带插入，furin 位点在同一位置至少被独立撞上三次——实验室起源论的概率论证站不住脚。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">病毒学</span><span class=\"tag\">深度测序</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The First Punic War corvus Mamertines Mix-Hellenes Monte Fortino\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-ancients-罗马的胜利靠一只乌鸦-第一次布匿战争的关键/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2e86106fe99ba32a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>罗马的胜利靠一只乌鸦：第一次布匿战争的关键</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">罗马靠一种叫 corvus 的登船吊桥把海战变成陆战，抵消了迦太基的水手优势；但迦太基请来一位斯巴达人重整军队，反手俘虏了罗马执政官。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古代史</span><span class=\"tag\">罗马</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"92. Is Poor Nutrition a Supply Problem or a Demand Problem? food desert external locus of control Nielsen Home Scan\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-nostupid-开一家新超市-只解决-10-的营养不平等/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85138dbf8396e511-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">32:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">No Stupid Questions</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>开一家新超市，只解决 10% 的营养不平等</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把健康食品的供给铺到低收入社区，只能缩小约 10% 的营养不平等，剩下 90% 由需求端决定——而需求是可以被税收和文化改变的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行为经济学</span><span class=\"tag\">公共政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Episode 252 - The Ice Age icehouse greenhouse cirque dropstone albedo\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-thecommondesce-冰期不是无尽的冬天-而是反复的分合/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f1123c3476b2c469-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:10:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Common Descent Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>冰期不是无尽的冬天，而是反复的分合</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">冰期与间冰期来回切换，把种群反复隔离又重连，这才是冰期塑造物种的真正机制；而人类活动可能把下一次冰期推迟数十万年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古气候</span><span class=\"tag\">冰川</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"363: Why Vegetables Are Good for Your Heart settle plate DNIC EPR sGC mTORC1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-thisweekinmicr-本生灯不减少平板污染-蔬菜护心另有机制/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/edf553b27ee2c1ff-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Microbiology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>本生灯不减少平板污染，蔬菜护心另有机制</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">本生灯在低污染环境下反而可能增加沉降菌落；蔬菜护心可能不是硝酸盐-亚硝酸盐-NO 通路，而是肠道菌把硝酸盐和铁做成 DNIC 直接激活 sGC。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">微生物学</span><span class=\"tag\">无菌操作</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"We Asked Fidelity&#x27;s Ex-President What Made Peter Lynch Great — and Where Private Credit Risk Hides private credit affiliated investments rating shopping auto-IRA reversion to the mean\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-excessreturns-私募信贷的风险藏在保险公司的评级里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cac5e72b6049e76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Excess Returns</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>私募信贷的风险藏在保险公司的评级里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">私募信贷大量进入保险公司，且多为关联方投资，评级由私营机构给出、系统性偏高；若按正确评级，保险公司每年要多留 4000-5000 亿美元资本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">私募信贷</span><span class=\"tag\">保险公司</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The History of Perfume: Mankind&#x27;s Millennia Long Battle Against Stank miasma theory ambergris nosegay fixative\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-extracredits-人类几千年对抗恶臭-香水最初是烧给神的烟/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8ffaf32042b4c196-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">16:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ExtraCredits</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>人类几千年对抗恶臭，香水最初是烧给神的烟</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">香水不是从奢侈享受开始的，而是从宗教焚香和防病开始的——欧洲人相信难闻的空气会传播疾病，于是用香味把自己围起来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">香水史</span><span class=\"tag\">宗教仪式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM Highlights: Astra as AGI, OpenAI&#x27;s Pause, Mythos @ Mozilla &amp; Human Agency vs Technocapitalism agent workday METR paper clipper safe harbor Dyson sphere\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-cogrev-astra-跨过-agi-门槛-但没人能审计它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/36e51d00f0d50003-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:42:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>Astra 跨过 AGI 门槛，但没人能审计它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Astra 让人类再也不用做某些任务，OpenAI 却只暂停了一半 RL 算力；外部审计被卡死在发布前两三天，房间里没有大人可以接锅。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">Astra</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Open Models Change The Economics of AI harness open weights router MLX DGX Spark\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-ycsp-企业最终八成-token-走开源模型-但只花两成预算/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f442bffca180d6cf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">57:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>企业最终八成 token 走开源模型，但只花两成预算</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">开源模型和闭源前沿模型不是替代关系：绝大多数 token 会走开源，最难的活留给前沿实验室，中间靠路由和编排把两者接起来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">推理成本</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Flexner Report Flexner Report AAMC The Usefulness of Useless Knowledge\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-stuffmissed-一份报告关掉上百所医学院-黑人医生从此断层/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>一份报告关掉上百所医学院，黑人医生从此断层</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Flexner Report 常被写成医学教育现代化的起点，但它同时让七所黑人医学院关掉五所，此后近四十年没有新的黑人医学院出现。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医学教育</span><span class=\"tag\">种族不平等</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Skeptics Guide #1105 - Sep 12 2026 physical reservoir computing island of stability coronagraph contingent learning big rip\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-skeptics-改一条物理定律-每个愿望都会反噬/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc4dc31b3b84e70d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:23:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Skeptics Guide</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>改一条物理定律，每个愿望都会反噬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dragon Con 现场的思想实验：只能改一条物理定律让科幻成真，结果每个愿望都被拆出没算进去的后果——反重力等于免费能源，超空间旅行等于把技术送给所有外星文明。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">物理定律</span><span class=\"tag\">太空望远镜</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Judith Dada on the Rise of the AfD model routing Pareto-frontier model Migrationshintergrund Aktienrente tech-brosphere\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-goodfight-德国车败给中国电动车-afd-崛起只是症状/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>德国车败给中国电动车，AfD 崛起只是症状</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AfD 不是德国问题而是西方问题：人们觉得明天不会更好，而德国引以为傲的汽车、化工、铁路同时失去竞争力，才是极右翼真正的燃料。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">欧洲科技</span><span class=\"tag\">AfD</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Companies Are Becoming a Series of Loops | Anish Acharya on Lenny’s Podcast autocatalytic effects RSI out of distribution thinking cornered resource revealed preferences stated preferences\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-a16z-公司正在变成一串嵌套的-loop-但-loop-只能爬到局部最优/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>公司正在变成一串嵌套的 loop，但 loop 只能爬到局部最优</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">prompt 之后是 agent，agent 之后是 loop。loop 会帮你爬到局部最大值然后平台化，这时需要人的直觉帮你落到下一座山的山脚。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>19</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">agent</span><span class=\"tag\">loop</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Robert Friedland on the World&#x27;s Monumental Shortage of Copper NPV model heap leach tailings dam solid oxide fuel cell\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-oddlots-铜矿品位从2-跌到0-4-ai的电力需求却要上天/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>铜矿品位从2%跌到0.4%，AI的电力需求却要上天</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">全球铜矿品位持续下滑、新矿审批要35年，而AI搜索耗电是普通搜索的30倍——供给在萎缩，需求在爆炸，铜正在变成新的石油。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">铜</span><span class=\"tag\">大宗商品</span>\n</div></div></a>"]